        <Abstract>
          <AbstractText Label="BACKGROUND">Traumatic brain injury (TBI) remains a major cause of death and disability worldwide. Despite decades of research, effective pharmacological treatments are still lacking.</AbstractText>
          <AbstractText Label="METHODS">We conducted a comprehensive review of recent advances in TBI prevention, clinical care, and research methodology.</AbstractText>
        </Abstract>
