        <Abstract>
          <AbstractText>Blood-based biomarkers for mild traumatic brain injury have shown promise in recent years. This systematic review evaluates the diagnostic accuracy of serum biomarkers including GFAP, UCH-L1, and S100B for detecting intracranial lesions after mild TBI.</AbstractText>
        </Abstract>
